  "description": "AV1 video decoding for CodeBrix.VideoPlayback. A source-generated binding over the dav1d decoder that decodes straight into the playback session's own frame-buffer pool - no copy between the decoder's output and the graphics upload - with self-built native libraries for Windows x64 and ARM64, macOS Intel and Apple Silicon, and Linux x64, ARM64 and RISC-V 64. One Register() call at start-up makes AV1 playable; nothing else in an application ever names a decoder type.",
